
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
   -       This is file "bou_newStyle.in"        -
   The configuration file for parameters in "afid"   
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
The user can configure "AFiD" by the switches below. Any option is to be 
written within primes (e. g., 'option'). A three-digits, left aligned numerical 
code is provided for each entry (e. g., 001). 

Contact: R. Hartmann rDOThartmannATutwenteDOTnl 
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

====> New / Restart Simulation ------------------------------------------------
101 Read in data from files (no=n, yes=y)    NREAD              'n'
102 Read in statistics from files (n/y)      STAREAD            'n'
103 Reset stats (n/y)                        IRESET             'n'

====> Grid specifications -----------------------------------------------------
201 Number of grid nodes                     NXM NYM NZM        '256' '1536' '001'
202 Axis length (vertical/stream/span)       ALX3D YLEN ZLEN    '1.0' '2.0' '0.001'
203 Grid distribution scheme V-Ax            ISTR3              '4'
204 Grid distribution parameter              STR3               '4.0'

====> Runtime limits ----------------------------------------------------------
301 Max number of timesteps                  NTST               '10000000'  
302 Max dimensionless time                   TMAX               '20.0'  
303 Max wallclock time [s]                   WALLTIMEMAX        '100000'

====> Numerical parameters ----------------------------------------------------
401 Numerical scheme                         NSST               '3'
    Modes: 1= 2nd order Adams Bashfort 
           3= 3rd order Runge Kutta 
402 Enable dynamic timesteps (n/y)           IDTV               'y'
403 FIRST or CONSTANT time step              DT                 '1.e-8'
404 Min/Max dynamic time step                DTMIN DTMAX        '1.e-8' '5.e-3'
405 Stability param for dynamic steps        CFLMAX             '1.0'
406 Max velocity divergence per step         RESID              '1.e-7'
    (mass conservation criterion)
407 Maximum local velocity                   VLIM               '1.e3'
408 Initial Pertubation on the Temp field    EPS                '0.01'
409 Flow time for initial conditions         INITIME            '200.0'
410 Implicit treatment for diffusive terms   IMPLICIT           'n'
    (in periodic directions (n/y))

====> Physical parameters -----------------------------------------------------
501 Rayleigh-Darcy number                    RA                 '1.0e4'     
----Boundary conditions for temperature
504 Boundary type (bottom/top)               INSLWS INSLWN      '1' '1'
    (Adiabatic=0, Dirchlet=1)
505 Boundary value (bottom/top)              TEMPBOT TEMPTOP    '1.0' '0.0'
    (Only applicable if Dirchlet type)
506 Gravity components                       GX GY GZ           '-1.0' '0.0' '0.0'
    (Automatically normalized inside code)

====> Output parameters -------------------------------------------------------
601 Output timestep interval                 NOUT               '10'
    for global quantities and stats
602 Enable statistic calculation (n/y)       STATON INSTON      'y' 'y'  
603 Enable dissipation calculation (n/y)     BALANCEON          'y'
604 Start time stat writing                  TSTA               '10.0'
605 Start & Interval for 3D Snapshots        STARTSNAP SAVESNAP '0.0' '1.0'
606 Enable output of wall normal slabs (n/y) SLABDUMP(STST3)    'y'
    at locations specified in stst3.in
607 Enable 2D Y and Z slices for movie (n/y) MOVIEON TFRAME     'y' '1.00'
